  "description": "The hijab is a headscarf worn by Muslim women as a religious and cultural expression of modesty and faith. The presence of two women wearing hijabs in the image implies a cultural context that may be unfamiliar to some viewers. Understanding the significance of the hijab as a symbol of identity, faith, and modesty is background knowledge required to interpret the scene without misrepresentation or stereotyping.",
